  "problem_statement": "DIV_ROUND(a, b), DIV_ROUND_UP(a, b), and a new DIV_ROUND_INF(a, b) must give correct integer rounding for negative operands as well as positive ones. DIV_ROUND must round to the nearest integer, with halves away from zero. DIV_ROUND_UP must round toward positive infinity. DIV_ROUND_INF must round away from zero. The results for positive operands must remain the same, and the macros must behave correctly for extreme values including UINT32_MAX and INT32_MIN.",
